keywords Summon Imp, The Stolen Tome, Beginnings, Drusilla La Salle, Alamar Grimm, Powers of the Void, Stolen Books, Feather Charm, Frostmane Novice, Northshire, Coldridge Valley, Anvilmar, Tainted Letter, Tainted Memorandum, Warlock, class pet
